  "1. 设置并扫描": "1. Configure and scan",
  "设置单套价格上限和购买逻辑后开始扫描。价格预测会在明显超出上限时提前跳过，减少请求和等待。": "Set a per-set price limit and purchase mode, then scan. Price prediction skips sets that clearly exceed the limit to reduce requests and waiting.",
  "2. 选择购买方式": "2. Choose how to buy",
  "“手动购买”会打开 Steam multibuy 并自动填写数量和价格；勾选结果后也可以批量提交长期订购单。": "Manual buy opens Steam multibuy with quantities and prices filled in. Select results to submit persistent buy orders in bulk.",
  "3. 理解购买价格": "3. Choose a price",
  "手动价格可选在售最低、平均价格或求购最高；智能定价可按订单墙选择保守、平衡或抢单。买价调整可正可负。": "Manual pricing supports lowest ask, average price, and highest bid. Smart pricing offers Conservative, Balanced, and Aggressive strategies. Offsets can be positive or negative.",
  "4. 管理已下订购单": "4. Manage buy orders",
  "“已下订购单”页显示 Steam 返回的当前剩余量。最低售价只在选择后手动查询并保留 10 分钟，智能价差只使用本次会话已有订单簿缓存。": "Buy orders shows remaining quantities reported by Steam. Lowest asks are fetched only on request for selected items and cached for 10 minutes. Smart price differences use order books already cached in this session.",
  "5. 批量合成徽章": "5. Craft badges in bulk",
  "在“徽章合成”页扫描已经收集齐全的卡组，可逐级升级或一次提交当前可合成最大次数。": "Scan complete sets in Craft badges. Craft one level at a time or submit the maximum available craft count at once.",
